      "stop_reason": "end_turn",
      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 either the Ingest agent or the Query agent \u2014 immediately before that process starts. The key is not held in the Hub\u0027s own process environment; instead, a local secrets loader reads it from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the child process\u0027s environment. This scoping prevents a compromised or misbehaving Hub process from leaking the credential by inspecting its own environment variables.",
